    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We at Felicity Fox are delighted to present to the market this superb ground floor, dual aspect, two bedroom apartment (83sqm/893sqft) with a south facing balcony overlooking the War Memorial Gardens.  This generously proportioned light filled property is in excellent condition and benefits from good storage. There is one designated secure, underground car parking space.\r\n\r\nOn walking through the front door a hallway leads to a large open plan living room with ample space for a large dining table and study area.  The south facing balcony is accessed from this room. The kitchen is located off the living room and is fitted with a range of wall and floor units.  There is a master bedroom which is a large double with fitted wardrobes and en suite with shower enclosure.  The second bedroom is also a large double with fitted wardrobes.  A bathroom with bath with shower overhead completes the accommodation. \r\n\r\nIslandbridge is situated on the banks of the River Liffey and is adjacent to the Phoenix Park and the Irish War Memorial Gardens. The village of Kilmainham is a short walk away and is host to the Irish Museum of Modern Art (IMMA) and Kilmainham Gaol Museum.  The area is very well served by transport links including Irish Rail at Heuston Station, the Luas red line and many Dublin Bus services. The N4 and M50 are easily accessed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall     3.72m x 1.12m \r\nCarpet flooring. Access to cupboard housing water tank.  Access to storage cupboard.\r\n\r\nLiving room     5.62m x 4.67m\r\nTimber floor. Double doors to south facing balcony. Opening to\r\n \r\nKitchen     2.96m x 2.39m\r\nTiled floor. Tiled splashback. Stainless steel sink unit. Range of wall and floor units. Integrated oven, hob and extractor fan.  Plumbing for tumble dryer, plumbing for washing machine.\r\n\r\nInner hall     4.70m x 0.95m\r\nCarpet flooring.\r\n \r\nMaster bedroom     4.26m x 2.89m\r\nCarpet flooring. Built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn suite     1.86m x 1.60m\r\nTiled floor. Part tiled walls. WC. Wash hand basin. Shower enclosure.\r\n \r\nBedroom 2     5.26m x 2.41m\r\nCarpet flooring. Built-in wardrobes.\r\n \r\nBathroom     2.39m x 1.77m\r\nTiled floor.  Part tiled walls. WC. Wash hand basin.  Bath with shower overhead."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ground floor 2 bed 2 bath apartment\r\nOne secure designated car parking space\r\nDual aspect\r\nSouth facing balcony overlooking War Memorial Gardens\r\nElectric storage heating\r\nDouble glazed Rationel timber framed windows\r\nManagement fee approximately €3,254 per annum\r\nLocated on the River Liffey next to the Phoenix Park\r\nTransport links include Heuston Station, Luas red line and Dublin Bus\r\nEasy access to N4 and M50"
      },
